	(text "LP-1106: Linux SBC on Rockchip RV1106G3 (Cortex-A7, 1 TOPS NPU, 256MB DDR3L in package). USB-C power+OTG, 10/100 Ethernet, SPI NAND boot, microSD, 2-lane MIPI CSI, debug UART, 2x10 GPIO.\n- 5V from USB-C (sink, 5.1k Rd), reverse-current Schottky to VSYS\n- Rails per RV1106 DS Table 3-2: VDD_0V9 0.81-0.95V, VCC_DDR 1.283-1.45V (DDR3L), VCC_1V8 1.62-1.98V, VCC_3V3 3.0-3.465V\n- Sequencing like Luckfox reference: 0.9V first, then DDR+1.8V (RC delay), then 3.3V\n- 4-layer JLC 7628 stackup, single-sided assembly, In1=GND plane\n- Boot from SPI NAND (FSPI), microSD on SDMMC0, console UART2_M1 115200"
		(at 25.4 170 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b503d02d-8c55-55e1-b83a-890e2d2f97a6")
	)
